                                "sense_id": "82d11b52-62d1-3fb9-a196-cf0660b45b1f",
                                "text": "зараба́тывать себе́ на пропита́ние",
                                "translation": "earn one's daily bread, earn one's living",
                                "english": "earn one's daily bread, earn one's living"
                            },
                            {
